    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n82295" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περιστρωφάω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>ply hither and thither</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μενοινήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nonn.
					<u>D.</u>
					41.264
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> intr.,
				<i>turn hither and thither</i>, prob. (for -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στροφέοντες</span>) in <i><span class="en">
